<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use | Kreativ Sound"
  description="Terms for using the Kreativ Sound website, digital products, downloads, and browser-based creative tools."
  canonical="https://kreativsound.com/terms/"
  activeNav=""
>
  <article class="card page-main policy-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="page-lead">Last updated July 23, 2026.</p>

    <section>
      <h2>Website and product information</h2>
      <p>Kreativ Sound provides product information, digital downloads, creative tools, guides, and links to external checkout services. Product formats, plugin requirements, contents, and prices are described on the relevant product page and checkout page.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Purchases</h2>
      <p>Paid and free downloads may be delivered through Gumroad or PayPal. The checkout provider's terms also apply to payment processing, receipts, account access, and delivery. You are responsible for confirming that you own the required synth, plugin, DAW, or compatible software before purchasing.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Permitted use</h2>
      <p>Unless a product page states otherwise, downloads are licensed for personal and commercial music, film, game, broadcast, and other audiovisual productions. The underlying presets, samples, files, and tools are not sold outright. See the <a href="/license/">Product License</a> for the complete usage rules.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Browser tools</h2>
      <p>Browser tools are provided as creative utilities and may be marked beta. Keep backups of original files and review exported results before production use. Kreativ Sound does not guarantee uninterrupted availability or compatibility with every browser, plugin version, or operating system.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Availability and changes</h2>
      <p>Products, prices, features, and supported formats may change. Previously purchased downloads remain subject to the description and license provided at the time of purchase, except where an update improves compatibility or corrects an error.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about these terms can be sent to <a href="mailto:info@kreativsound.com">info@kreativsound.com</a>. Nothing in these terms limits rights that cannot legally be excluded under applicable consumer law.</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
